# Used by fastrdp-brokerd only to get a Kerberos TGT for GNOME/Plasma sessions
# ([broker] session_tgt). The login was already authenticated and authorised (PAM
# service fastrdp, MFA); this stack only hands the known password to pam_sss, whose
# krb5_child stores the TGT in the user's credential cache (KCM:).
# No pam_faillock: a stale delegated password must not lock the account for fastrdp.
# The broker never calls the account, password or session phases here.
auth     required  pam_sss.so
account  required  pam_deny.so
password required  pam_deny.so
session  required  pam_deny.so
